# While Rockford hatched: the acid ate all the dirt, left and down, and is
# gone; the expanding walls grew left and down; the water flows left and
# down, a cell each 16 steps (WATER_1 ... WATER_16, then WATER)
= no=ACID no=DIRT @1,1=H_EXPANDING_WALL @8,2=V_EXPANDING_WALL @3,4=WATER* @5,5=WATER*
= heard=HISS heard=GROW
60.
= @1,4=WATER @1,5=WATER
